#: ../../05-data-and-api.md:5 344755909e6a4f71b0603c5cf388b814
msgid ""
"Contracts in this tree are **not** OpenAPI/REST. Call control is ESL + "
"console/API strings; config is XML; signaling is SIP or Verto JSON-RPC; the "
"core scoreboard is SQL. `scripts/extract_api_signatures.py` found no "
"Tauri/HTTP routes (`man/_generated/05-data-and-api.signatures.generated.md`)"
" — expected for a C softswitch."
msgstr ""
"本树中的契约**不是** OpenAPI/REST。呼叫控制是 ESL + 控制台/API 字符串；配置是 XML；信令是 SIP 或 Verto "
"JSON-RPC；核心记分板是 SQL。`scripts/extract_api_signatures.py` 未发现 Tauri/HTTP "
"路由（`man/_generated/05-data-and-api.signatures.generated.md`）——对 C "
"软交换而言这是预期结果。"

#: ../../05-data-and-api.md:7 9a5df710af1143a48352e4984a6d8fca
msgid ""
"Live command list at runtime: `fs_cli -x help` (every `SWITCH_ADD_API` "
"registration). Dialplan apps: `show applications`. Event names: "
"`src/include/switch_types.h`."
msgstr ""
"运行时实时命令列表：`fs_cli -x help`（每个 `SWITCH_ADD_API` 注册）。拨号计划应用：`show "
"applications`。事件名：`src/include/switch_types.h`。"

