#: ../../05-data-and-api.md:34 ec0653c1e3f543e2b0bd8325c6535d2b
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Preprocessor: `#include` / `#set` / `X-PRE-PROCESS`. **`$${name}`** expands "
"during assembly (global, `vars.xml`); **`${name}`** expands at call time on "
"a channel ([Chapter "
"3](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/configuration/xml)). "
"Flattened file: `$log_dir/freeswitch.xml.fsxml` (typically `$prefix/log/`; "
"comment in `conf/vanilla/freeswitch.xml`). Do not edit it while running."
msgstr ""
"预处理器：`#include` / `#set` / `X-PRE-PROCESS`。**`$${name}`** "
"在组装时展开（全局，`vars.xml`）；**`${name}`** 在呼叫时对通道展开（[第 3 "
"章](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/configuration/xml)）。展平文件：`$log_dir/freeswitch.xml.fsxml`（通常在"
" `$prefix/log/`；见 `conf/vanilla/freeswitch.xml` 注释）。运行中不要编辑。"

#: ../../05-data-and-api.md:36 2c1114af1a2a4412a7f2f60b64c6aa77
msgid ""
"Directory / dialplan / SIP-profile parameter tables: [Users Manual Ch "
"6](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/users-and-endpoints/user-"
"directory), [Ch "
"12](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/dialplan/xml), [Ch "
"7](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/users-and-endpoints/sip-"
"profiles). This page lists the **contracts as implemented in this tree**, "
"not every XML attribute."
msgstr ""
"号码簿 / 拨号计划 / SIP profile 参数表：[用户手册第 6 "
"章](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/users-and-endpoints/user-"
"directory)、[第 12 "
"章](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/dialplan/xml)、[第 7 "
"章](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/users-and-endpoints/sip-"
"profiles)。本页列出的是**本仓库已实现的契约**，不是每一个 XML 属性。"

#: ../../05-data-and-api.md:38 154559af6fed4a2cb69d098f7c4f845d
msgid "Storage and Persistence Rules"
msgstr "存储与持久化规则"

#: ../../05-data-and-api.md:40 e57ce75b4aab4377a1172213bbdac75c
msgid ""
"**Primary storage**: SQLite core DB under prefix `db/` (initialized in "
"`switch_core_init`). Optional ODBC / `mod_pgsql` / `mod_mariadb`. Disable "
"scoreboard with `freeswitch -nosql`."
msgstr ""
"**主存储**：前缀 `db/` 下的 SQLite 核心数据库（在 `switch_core_init` 中初始化）。可选 ODBC / "
"`mod_pgsql` / `mod_mariadb`。用 `freeswitch -nosql` 禁用记分板。"

#: ../../05-data-and-api.md:41 81e653f1cd004d9fba4674f77c70815d
msgid ""
"**Schema source**: SQL strings in C, not migrations. Core: "
"`src/switch_core_sqldb.c` (`create_channels_sql`, `create_calls_sql`, "
"`create_interfaces_sql`, `create_tasks_sql`, `create_nat_sql`, "
"`create_registrations_sql`, `recovery_sql`, aliases/complete). Sofia: "
"`src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/sofia_glue.c` (`sip_registrations`, "
"`sip_presence`, `sip_dialogs`, `sip_subscriptions`, `sip_authentication`, "
"shared-appearance tables)."
msgstr ""
"**模式来源**：C 中的 SQL "
"字符串，而非迁移。核心：`src/switch_core_sqldb.c`（`create_channels_sql`、`create_calls_sql`、`create_interfaces_sql`、`create_tasks_sql`、`create_nat_sql`、`create_registrations_sql`、`recovery_sql`、aliases/complete）。Sofia：`src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/sofia_glue.c`（`sip_registrations`、`sip_presence`、`sip_dialogs`、`sip_subscriptions`、`sip_authentication`、shared-"
"appearance 表）。"

#: ../../05-data-and-api.md:42 79300a1e589d455a8fbc87d547f96158
msgid ""
"**Core `channels` columns** (scoreboard): `uuid`, `direction`, `created` / "
"`created_epoch`, `name`, `state`, `cid_name` / `cid_num`, `ip_addr`, `dest`,"
" `application` / `application_data`, `dialplan`, `context`, codecs/rates, "
"`secure`, `hostname`, presence, `accountcode`, `callstate`, callee fields, "
"`call_uuid`, initial-* copies."
msgstr ""
"**核心 `channels` 列**（记分板）：`uuid`、`direction`、`created` / "
"`created_epoch`、`name`、`state`、`cid_name` / "
"`cid_num`、`ip_addr`、`dest`、`application` / "
"`application_data`、`dialplan`、`context`、编解码器/采样率、`secure`、`hostname`、presence、`accountcode`、`callstate`、被叫字段、`call_uuid`、initial-*"
" 副本。"

#: ../../05-data-and-api.md:43 4a472b77a51e41fcb15c35d2b1cb94d5
msgid ""
"**Consistency**: one session thread owns a channel. SQL is a **projection** "
"for `show channels` / recovery, not the source of truth. `hostname` / "
"`switchname` isolate rows in multi-host configs."
msgstr ""
"**一致性**：一条会话线程拥有一个通道。SQL 是用于 `show channels` / 恢复的**投影**，不是事实来源。`hostname` /"
" `switchname` 在多主机配置中隔离行。"

#: ../../05-data-and-api.md:44 69d37d391c25414f94fc9a45014ef9d8
msgid ""
"**CDR**: not in core SQL. Vanilla loads `mod_cdr_csv` (Asterisk-style CSV). "
"Optional `mod_json_cdr`, `mod_xml_cdr`, `mod_cdr_sqlite`, `mod_odbc_cdr`, "
"`mod_cdr_pg_csv`."
msgstr ""
"**CDR**：不在核心 SQL 中。Vanilla 加载 `mod_cdr_csv`（Asterisk 风格 CSV）。可选 "
"`mod_json_cdr`、`mod_xml_cdr`、`mod_cdr_sqlite`、`mod_odbc_cdr`、`mod_cdr_pg_csv`。"

#: ../../05-data-and-api.md:45 56728ede5a564f46a1bc7233b7f7b997
msgid ""
"**Retention**: operator-owned log/CDR rotation. `[NEEDS INPUT: site "
"retention policy]`."
msgstr "**保留策略**：由运维负责日志/CDR 轮转。`[NEEDS INPUT: site retention policy]`。"

