msgstr "校验与兼容性"

#: ../../05-data-and-api.md:142 ab553f05e89f46ea897c7c9d74a2bd5d
msgid ""
"**XML**: well-formed document after preprocessor; bad root fails startup "
"(`switch_xml_open_root`). Dialplan conditions are regex on channel "
"fields/vars (`mod_dialplan_xml`)."
msgstr ""
"**XML**：预处理器之后必须是格式良好的文档；根节点错误会导致启动失败（`switch_xml_open_root`）。拨号计划条件是对通道字段/变量的正则（`mod_dialplan_xml`）。"

#: ../../05-data-and-api.md:143 32f8144c7e6d4e71a6570c41e0a5ffe5
msgid ""
"**SIP auth**: directory digest + profile `auth-calls` + ACL (`apply-inbound-"
"acl` → `domains` list in `acl.conf.xml`)."
msgstr ""
"**SIP 认证**：directory digest + 配置文件 `auth-calls` + ACL（`apply-inbound-acl` → "
"`acl.conf.xml` 中的 `domains` 列表）。"

#: ../../05-data-and-api.md:144 fc3c694f6d82443198021414be70019d
msgid ""
"**ESL**: must `auth` before other commands; wrong password closes the socket"
" (`-ERR invalid`)."
msgstr "**ESL**：其他命令之前必须 `auth`；密码错误会关闭套接字（`-ERR invalid`）。"

#: ../../05-data-and-api.md:145 c9a43dc5e2c94f3daca27e86b5e21548
msgid ""
"**API/apps**: stringly typed; `help` / app syntax strings are the contract. "
"Unknown API → error text, not HTTP codes."
msgstr "**API/应用**：字符串类型；`help` / 应用语法字符串即契约。未知 API 返回错误文本，而不是 HTTP 状态码。"

#: ../../05-data-and-api.md:146 ecb06c0630624fef885ff13e89ec6a42
msgid ""
"**Backward compatibility**: event **names** and common headers are the long-"
"lived contract (1.x line). Adding headers is common; removing `Event-Name` /"
" `Unique-ID` is not. XML schema is conventional, not XSD-enforced (DTD "
"folder `dtd/` exists for some docs). Version is `1.11.3-dev` in "
"`configure.ac`."
msgstr ""
"**向后兼容**：事件**名称**与常见头是长期契约（1.x 系列）。增加头很常见；删除 `Event-Name` / `Unique-ID` "
"则不是。XML schema 是约定俗成的，并非 XSD 强制（`dtd/` 目录存在于部分文档）。版本为 `configure.ac` 中的 "
"`1.11.3-dev`。"

#: ../../05-data-and-api.md:147 3a3826f5b3244c5ea4e570e86f9f0a3e
msgid ""
"**Secrets in contracts**: vanilla directory passwords and ESL `ClueCon` are "
"demo values — not a stable security model."
msgstr "**契约中的密钥**：vanilla directory 密码和 ESL `ClueCon` 是演示值——不是稳定的安全模型。"

